# Everything the image does not need. The build context is sent to the daemon
# before anything runs, so what is listed here is what is not uploaded.

node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
.next-verify
*.tsbuildinfo

.git
.github
.vscode
.idea

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# The docs site and the SDK are published on their own and are no part of the
# app image. Their manifests are still needed: the lockfile covers every
# workspace member, and --frozen-lockfile checks all of them.
#
# The Markdown is the exception. The app serves the documentation itself, so
# those pages are part of the image even though VitePress and its theme are
# not: an instance behind a firewall has to be able to read its own manual.
docs
!docs/package.json
!docs/**/*.md
packages
!packages/*/package.json

worker/.wrangler

# Docs, except the one the repository page shows.
*.md
!README.md
